WEBVTT

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.720
One of the most traditional and anticipated
Grammy categories is Best New Artist.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.800
It's for new names in music who
stood out in the US market and

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.600
released albums the previous year.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:23.200
Past winners include the Beatles,
Mariah Carey, Maroon 5, Adele and

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:28.640
Billie Eilish. But there were also big
artists who were nominated and lost, like

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:34.179
Led Zeppelin, Elton John, Kanye West,
Justin Bieber, Rosalía and others.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:39.680
Proof that taking part is what
counts, as with Tom Jobim, who lost

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.640
Best New Artist to the Beatles in 1965.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:48.000
And speaking of him, this year we're
coming in strong with our own Girl from

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.700
Rio, Anitta, who sampled
The Girl from Ipanema.

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:58.960
Tonight, Anitta goes up against big
names in one of the biggest categories

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.800
of the awards: Best New Artist.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.779
And if the fans have a say, that
gramophone already belongs to Brazil.
